WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
You can rest assured

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,440
I, Brother Xiao, deliberately say that he will never mess around.

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,240
We don’t do business just this time

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,120
From now on, you have to pay me money every month.

5
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,120
Let's pay it for one month first.

6
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,120
Wait until you have money before paying

7
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,120
Anyway, you have to be easy to talk to.

8
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,680
I am a better person to talk to than you.

9
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,960
Hahaha

10
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,640
Thank you, old man, young man

11
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,200
I think you are a good person

12
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,200
Let me tell you the truth

13
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,360
If someone else comes to rent

14
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,040
Don't say you're giving him a rent reduction.

15
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,040
I asked him to keep some of the money with me.

16
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:24,080
But I think you are a kinder person.

17
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,970
That's it then

18
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:32,860
Thank you, Brother Xiao

19
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,740
You spent a lot of money here

20
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:36,540
Two thousand seven is really not cheap.

21
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,980
But I can’t say they are expensive.

22
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,500
Mainly because we don’t actually need to

23
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,540
It is necessary

24
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,460
I will collect some used clothes here from now on

25
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:45,460
There are also some other messy things, Brother Xiao

26
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,780
Are you ready for a big fight, Brother Xiao?

27
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,660
If you really do any work, you have to call me.

28
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,540
Anyway, I will do whatever you ask me to do

29
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,380
Although I'm not as powerful as you

30
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:55,380
But I am also a more obedient person

31
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,940
And I'm definitely not lazy

32
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:59,220
I'm just not as physically fit as you are.
